con\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion\" title=\"Infernal Legion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Legion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion\" title=\"Infernal Legion\">Infernal Legion</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Infernal_Legion\">Creatures with Infernal Legion</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png/30px-Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png/45px-Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png/60px-Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Merregon Legionnaire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png/30px-Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Portrait_Merregon_Legionnaire.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\">Merregon Legionnaire</a></li>\n</ul></div